# apple-workflows

Manage Apple Notes, Reminders, and Shortcuts with AI agents via a local MCP server on macOS.

## MCP Configuration

MCP servers for this plugin are in `.cursor/mcp.json`. Environment variables use `${env:VAR_NAME}` syntax in Cursor.

> **Note:** Hooks are Claude Code-format and are not translated to Cursor `.cursor/hooks.json`.
